msgid ""
"The following names appeared both in the data set and in the user specified "
"data:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"De volgende namen komen zowel voor in de gegevens als in de door de "
"gebruiker gespecificeerde gegevens:\n"
"%s"

msgid "Please specify which parameters to monitor!"
msgstr "Specificeer a.u.b. welke parameters moeten worden beoordeeld!"

msgid "Please specify which parameters to show output for!"
msgstr ""
"Specificeer a.u.b. voor welke parameters de uitvoer moet worden getoond!"

msgid "MCMC Summary"
msgstr "MCMC Samenvatting"

msgid ""
"Summarizes the posterior samples of each parameter selected under 'Show "
"results for these parameters': the posterior mean, median, and standard "
"deviation, the 95%% credible interval, the R-hat statistic (point estimate "
"and upper bound of its confidence interval) used to diagnose convergence of "
"the MCMC chains, and the effective sample size."
msgstr ""

msgid "Posterior"
msgstr "Posterior"

msgid "95%% Credible Interval"
msgstr "95%% Geloofwaardigheidsinterval"

msgid "Rhat"
msgstr "R-dakje"

msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

msgid "Mean"
msgstr "Gemiddelde"

msgid "Median"
msgstr "Mediaan"

msgid "SD"
msgstr "SD"

msgid "Lower"
msgstr "Onder"

msgid "Upper"
msgstr "Boven"

msgid "Point est."
msgstr "Puntschatting."

msgid "Upper CI"
msgstr "Bovengrens GI"

msgid "Effective Sample Size"
msgstr "Effectieve Steekproefgrootte"

msgid "Output based on %s MCMC draws."
msgstr "Output gebaseerd op %s MCMC trekkingen."

msgid "No data was supplied, everything was sampled from the priors!"
msgstr "Geen data gegeven, alles gesampled van de priors!"

msgid "Deviance cannot be computed without data."
msgstr "Deviatie kan niet berekend worden zonder gegevens."

msgid ""
"Failed to compute the Rhat statistic. This is expected if the model contains "
"discrete parameters."
msgstr ""
"Kan de R-dakje statistiek niet berekenen. Dit is te verwachten als het model "
"discrete parameters bevat."

msgid "The multivariate potential scale reduction factor is estimated at %.3f."
msgstr "De multivariaat potentieelschaal reductiefactor is geschat op %.3f."

msgid ""
"The multivariate potential scale reduction factor could not be computed. "
"This could indicate convergence issues, carefully examine the trace plots "
"and r-hat estimates."
msgstr ""
"De multivariate potentiële schaalreductiefactor kon niet worden berekend. "
"Dit kan duiden op convergentieproblemen, onderzoek de sporenplots en r-"
"hatschattingen zorgvuldig."

msgid ""
"Rhat statistic cannot be computed for only one chain. It is strongly "
"recommoned to run more than one chain to assess MCMC convergence!"
msgstr ""
"R-dakje statistiek kan niet worden berekend voor een enkele ketting. We "
"bevelen aan meer dan één ketting uit te voeren om MCMC convergentie te "
"beoordelen!"

msgid "Marginal Density"
msgstr "Marginale Dichtheid"

msgid ""
"Shows the marginal density of the posterior samples for each parameter "
"selected under 'Show results for these parameters'. If 'Aggregate chains for "
"densities and histograms' is checked then a single density line for each "
"parameter is shown. Otherwise, different colors are used to represent the "
"different chains."
msgstr ""

msgid "Marginal Histogram"
msgstr "Marginale Histogram"

msgid ""
"Shows the marginal histogram of the posterior samples for each parameter "
"selected under 'Show results for these parameters'. If 'Aggregate chains for "
"densities and histograms' is checked then a single histogram for each "
"parameter is shown. Otherwise, different colors are used to represent the "
"different chains."
msgstr ""

msgid "Trace Plots"
msgstr "Traceerplots"

msgid ""
"Shows a trace plot of the posterior samples for each parameter selected "
"under 'Show results for these parameters'."
msgstr ""

msgid "Autocorrelation Plots"
msgstr "Auto-correlatie grafieken"

msgid ""
"Plots the autocorrelation of the posterior samples for each parameter "
"selected under 'Show results for these parameters'."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bivariate Scatter Plot"
msgstr "Bivariate Spreidingsgrafiek"

msgid ""
"Shows a matrix plot of all pairs of parameters. The diagonal plot entries "
"show a density plot or histogram. The off-diagonal plot entries show a "
"bivariate plot, either a hexagonal histogram or a contour plot."
msgstr ""

msgid "Density"
msgstr "Dichtheid"

msgid "Chain"
msgstr "Ketting"

msgid "Counts"
msgstr "Aantallen"

msgid "Iteration"
msgstr "Iteratie"

msgid "Autocorrelation"
msgstr "Autocorrelatie"

msgid "Lag"
msgstr "Vertraging"

msgid ""
"At least two parameters need to be monitored and shown to make a bivariate "
"scatter plot!"
msgstr ""
"Minstens twee parameters moeten worden gemonitord en weergegeven om een "
"bivariate spreidingsgrafiek te maken!"

msgid "Custom output for %s"
msgstr "Aangepaste uitkomst voor %s"

msgid ""
"The custom results of a tab of 'Customizable Inference' for its parameter."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Warning. There are fewer levels in \"split by\" (%1$s has %2$d levels) than "
"in the parameter or parameter subset (%3$d levels)"
msgstr ""
"Waarschuwing. Er zijn minder niveaus in \"gesplitst door\" (%1$s heeft %2$d "
"niveaus) dan in de parameter of parametersubset (%3$d niveaus)"

msgid "Stacked density"
msgstr "Gestapelde dichtheid"

msgid ""
"Shows the posterior density of each element of the parameter (subset) "
"stacked on top of each other, ordered by the metric chosen in 'Order "
"parameters by'. Optionally, an interval is shaded and data are superimposed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Inference for %s"
msgstr "Inferentie voor %s"

msgid ""
"Shows the statistics and intervals selected under 'Estimation' for each "
"element of the parameter (subset)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Statistic"
msgstr "Statistiek"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modus"

msgid "%s%% Credible Interval"
msgstr "%s%% Geloofwaardigheidsinterval"

msgid "%s%% HDI"
msgstr "%s%% HDI"

msgid "%1$s%2$sIn addition:%3$s%4$s"
msgstr "%1$s%2$sDaarnaast:%3$s%4$s"

msgid "The model contains more '%1$s' than '%2$s' (%3$d vs %4$d)"
msgstr "Het model bevat meer '%1$s' dan '%2$s' (%3$d vs %4$d)"

msgid ""
"There was a problem loading JAGS, JAGS_HOME is: '%1$s'.\n"
"Please contact the JASP team for support.\n"
"Error was: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"JAGS, JAGS_HOME kon niet worden geladen: '%1$s'.\n"
"Neem contact op met het JASP-team voor ondersteuning.\n"
"Fout: %2$s."

msgid "Expected JAGS version 4.3.0 but found %s"
msgstr "Verwachtte JAGS versie 4.3.0 maar vond %s"

msgid ""
"Failed to export the samples because the directory to save them in does not "
"exist."
msgstr ""
"Het exporteren van de steekproeven is mislukt omdat de map om ze in op te "
"slaan niet bestaat."

msgid "Failed to export the samples because the following error occured: %s"
msgstr ""
"Het exporteren van de steekproeven is mislukt, omdat de volgende fout is "
"opgetreden: %s"

msgid ""
"The R code for %1$s crashed with error:\n"
"%2$s"
msgstr ""
"De R code voor %1$s is gecrasht met fout:\n"
"%2$s"

msgid ""
"The result of %1$s R code should be numeric but it was of mode %2$s and "
"class %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Het resultaat van %1$s R code moet numeriek zijn maar was van type %2$s en "
"klasse %3$s"

msgid ""
"The following error occured while loading the jags modules \"glm\" and "
"\"dic\": %s."
msgstr ""
"De volgende fout is opgetreden tijdens het laden van de jags modules \"glm\" "
"en \"dic\": %s."

#~ msgid "%1$s(%2$s < %3$s < %4$s)"
#~ msgstr "%1$s(%2$s < %3$s < %4$s)"
